## 🐛 Troubleshooting

### Port already in use
```bash
# Find process using the port
lsof -i :{{.Port}}

# Kill the process
kill -9 <PID>
```

### Build errors
```bash
# Clean and rebuild
go clean
go mod tidy
go build
```

